    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O'Gara are delighted to introduce this impeccably presented one-bedroom ground-floor apartment, nestled within a sought-after development just off the KCR, offering unparalleled access to the heart of the city.\r\n\r\nSet within a contemporary and secluded enclave off the KCR, this modern apartment boasts proximity to lush green spaces such as Bushy Park and Harold's Cross Park, providing a serene escape amidst the urban hustle. Whether you're seeking an investment opportunity or purchasing your first home, this apartment, maintained in excellent condition, promises both comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you're greeted by a well-appointed hallway leading to an inviting open-plan living/dining/kitchen area—a perfect space for relaxation or entertaining guests. The bedroom offers a tranquil retreat, while the bathroom is neatly presented.\r\n\r\nConveniently located within walking or easy cycling distance are the charming villages of Sundrive, Kimmage, Terenure, and Rathgar, each offering an array of amenities and services. Additionally, the proximity to renowned primary and secondary schools makes this area ideal for families.\r\n\r\nTransportation is a breeze with an extensive network of buses, including the 9, 15a, , 83, 54a, 74, S2 and S4 providing direct access to the City Centre, Dundrum, St. James Hospital, Heuston, UCD and beyond. The nearby M-50 ensures seamless connectivity to major routes and Dublin Airport, making commuting a hassle-free experience.\r\n\r\nProperty features\r\nc. 46 sq. m. (495 sq. ft.)\r\nElectric heating\r\nD2 – BER rating\r\nDesignated parking\r\nManagement fees: €1,850\r\nYear of construction: 1999"
      },
